WHOAMI(1)                      P32W Unix                       WHOAMI(1)

NAME
       whoami - print the effective user's name

SYNOPSIS
       whoami

DESCRIPTION
       whoami prints the name of the effective user id, from
       /etc/passwd, or ? if the id has no entry. After su(1) it
       names the new user; who(1) still shows the login name.

EXAMPLES
       $ su
       Password:
       # whoami
       root

FILES
       /etc/passwd

EXIT STATUS
       0, even when the name is unknown.

SEE ALSO
       id(1), who(1), su(1)
